# name: ENV-001
# type: markdown
# timestamp: 2026-07-29T23:00:33.237779Z
|kde_governance_environment_verification_policy
  |document_id=ENV-001
  |version=1.0.0
  |date=2026-07-26
  |status=APPROVED
  |authority=KDE Governance (KDE-INV-052 REC-002)
|purpose
|policy_statement
  |rule_1_pre-investigation_verification
    |runtime_state=`.kde/runtime/state.json` shows "ready"
    |required_tools=All project-specific toolchains are available
    |project_dependencies=Required packages/dependencies are installed
    |rule_2_environment-specific_verification
      |items
        ||[ ] `go` command is available (`which go` returns path)
        ||[ ] Go version meets minimum requirement (check go.mod)
        ||[ ] Dependencies available (`go mod download` or `go mod verify`)
        ||[ ] `python3` command is available
        ||[ ] Python version meets minimum requirement (3.10+)
        ||[ ] Dependencies available (pip list or requirements.txt)
        ||[ ] Primary language toolchain available
        ||[ ] Package manager accessible
        ||[ ] Project dependencies installed
      |rule_3_promise_prohibition
        |rule_4_failure_documentation
      |verification_procedures
        |pre-investigation_checklist
          |environment_verification_checklist
            |runtime_state
              |items
                ||[ ] .kde/runtime/state.json exists
                ||[ ] status is "ready"
                ||[ ] all modules are "loaded"
              |toolchain_go_project
                |items
                  ||[ ] `which go` returns a path
                  ||[ ] `go version` shows version >= 1.21
                  ||[ ] `go env GOPATH` is set
                |dependencies
                  |items
                    ||[ ] go.mod exists
                    ||[ ] `go mod verify` passes
                    ||[ ] No missing dependencies reported
                  |result
                    |items
                      ||[ ] Environment VERIFIED - proceed with investigation
                      ||[ ] Environment FAILED - document and report limitation
                    |verification_commands
                      |check_go_availability
                        |check_go_module
                          |check_build_capability
                        |compliance_verification
                          |check_pre-investigation_verification
                            |items
                              ||[ ] Investigation documents runtime state check
                              ||[ ] Investigation documents toolchain verification
                              ||[ ] Investigation documents dependency check
                            |check_promise_prohibition
                              |items
                                ||[ ] No test execution promised without verification
                                ||[ ] Any limitations are documented in investigation
                                ||[ ] User is informed of environment limitations
                          |violations
                            |table
                              ||['Violation', 'Severity', 'Example', 'Remediation']
                              ||['Missing runtime state check', 'HIGH', "Didn't verify state.json", 'Add verification step']
                              ||['Missing toolchain verification', 'HIGH', 'Promised tests without `which go`', 'Add check before promises']
                              ||['Unfulfilled test promise', 'CRITICAL', 'Said "I\'ll run tests" but Go missing', 'Document limitation first']
                              ||['Missing dependency check', 'MEDIUM', "Didn't run `go mod verify`", 'Add verification step']
                          |enforcement
                            |bootstrap_gate=Environment verification is part of Bootstrap Module 0
                            |investigation_documentation=All investigations must document verification
                            |meta-investigation=Violations trigger meta-investigation (per KDE-INV-051)
                          |related_policies
                            |items
                              ||DEP-001: Runtime Dependencies Policy
                              ||NAMING-CONVENTIONS.md: Artifact naming requirements
                          |version_history
                            |table
                              ||['Version', 'Date', 'Change', 'Authority']
                              ||['1.0.0', '2026-07-26', 'Initial policy', 'KDE-INV-052 REC-002']
                          |status=ENFORCED
                          |review_date=Upon any environment-related incident